<title>THAILAND: Thai Telephone first quarter net falls.</title>
<headline>Thai Telephone first quarter net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     0.06	 vs	     0.31</p>
<p>    Net		     44.40	 vs	   154.71</p>
<p>Notes: Results are reviewed. Thai Telephone and Telecommunication Plc is a fixed-line telephone company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
